  "implementation": [
    "Factor checked element place without changing whole-owner read tracking or joined-root merging.",
    "For indexed updates, deep-clone only plain/stable row metadata, select offset and load old leaf before RHS/self; preserve extent protection, sibling alias writes, shape updates and post-RHS address validation.",
    "Fuse a single project over array_op.get only for physical data places on plain/stable merged rows. Evaluate collection/index once in original order/depth, preserve view bounds and source-expression charges.",
    "After an unsupported physical projection probe, load the whole already-checked row, release temporary protection before restoring the get type evidence and invoking the ordinary getter. Variants/borrows retain existing loading behavior."
  ],
  "review": "Astra xhigh reviewed exact implementation and found/fixed the temporary-View fallback protection regression; baseline/current executed getter-shrink case covers it. No final blockers.",
